From: Diego <me@diegonmarcos.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 15:13:55 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 11/15] Cloud-Dialer: bottom-sheet provider chooser (real app
 icons) + Default-call-provider setting
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

UI overhaul of the per-call provider chooser:
- New CallProviderChooserSheet (BaseBottomSheetDialogFragment): one row per way
  to reach the number — Cellular + each available provider — with the provider
  app's actual launcher icon; replaces the bare RadioGroupDialog. Commons'
  SimpleListItem sheet is resource-id-only, hence the small custom sheet.
- New Settings ▸ Calling ▸ 'Default call provider': Always ask (default) /
  Cellular / any installed provider from assets/call_providers.json. A set
  default skips the chooser; fails open back to the sheet when the default
  can't reach the dialed number. Pref: Config.defaultCallProvider.
